Package: partisanIdentity
Type: Project
Title: Misperceptions about Party Composition and Partisan Identification
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Douglas J.", "Ahler", role = "aut"),
    person("Gaurav", "Sood", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "gsood07@gmail.com")
  )
Description: Data, analyses and manuscript for a 2018 TESS survey experiment
    that corrected weak and leaning partisans' overestimates of party-stereotypical
    groups in their own party and measured the effect on partisan attachment.
Encoding: UTF-8
